## Acceptance criteria

After your changes, the dashboard must satisfy all of:

1. Exactly 4 KPI cards in the top strip, not 11.
2. Latest prediction shown as a rounded integer (`452`), never a 10-decimal float.
3. No half-donut gauge anywhere.
4. No horizontal bars on the result panel showing input features as percentages.
5. Batch chart has a real y-axis with tick labels, x-axis labeled with each prediction's hour, value labels above each bar — never 3 same-height blue squares.
6. Form labels are human words (`Hour`, `Humidity`, `Wind`) with human units (`23 °C`, `14 km/h`, `45%`). Never raw column names or 0–1 floats.
7. Evidence shows `<n> of <total> available` with a quiet pending list. Never red `missing` tiles.
8. Single accent color `#8FB3FF`. No cyan/blue/green/amber/red mixed.
9. Exactly two font weights (400, 500), sentence case throughout.
10. No gradients, drop shadows, glow effects, or pill badges.

If any criterion fails, redo that section before moving on.

## When in doubt

Pick the more restrained option.
